[211.766086, "i", "cat > /app/LAYOUT_SHIFT_FIXES.md << 'EOF'\n# Layout Shift Fixes Summary\n\n## Issues Identified and Fixed\n\n### 1. ProductCard.tsx\n**Problem:** Used regular `<img>` tag without dimensions, causing Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)\n**Solution:** \n- Replaced `<img>` with Next.js `Image` component\n- Added aspect-square container with relative positioning\n- Used `fill` prop with `object-cover` for proper sizing\n- Added `sizes` attribute for responsive images\n- Preserved all data-testid attributes and class names\n\n### 2. layout.tsx\n**Problem:** No optimized font loading, causing FOUT (Flash of Unstyled Text)\n**Solution:**\n- Added `next/font/google` import for Inter font\n- Configured font with `display: 'swap'` for optimal loading\n- Applied font className to body element\n- Prevents font-swap layout shifts\n\n### 3. Banner.tsx\n**Problem:** Returns null while loading, then suddenly appears with py-24 (96px padding)\n**Solution:**\n- Added loading state that maintains same dimensions\n- Shows loading placeholder with same padding during fetch\n- Prevents sudden appearance causing layout shift\n\n### 4. LateBanner.tsx\n**Problem:** Returns null while loading, then appears with py-32 (128px padding)\n**Solution:**\n- Added loading state with consistent dimensions\n- Shows loading placeholder during fetch\n- Maintains layout stability\n\n### 5. ProductList.tsx\n**Problem:** Shows small loading text, then switches to 3-column grid layout\n**Solution:**\n- Uses ProductSkeleton components in same grid layout (3 columns, 15 items)\n- Maintains consistent layout structure during loading\n- Smooth transition from skeleton to actual products\n\n### 6. SidePane.tsx\n**Problem:** Returns null while loading, then appears with 220px width, shifting main content\n**Solution:**\n- Added loading skeleton with same 220px width\n- Shows placeholder categories and filters during fetch\n- Prevents main content area from shifting\n\n### 7. ResultsBar.tsx\n**Problem:** Returns null while loading, then appears with py-4 padding and content\n**Solution:**\n- Added loading skeleton matching exact dimensions\n- Shows placeholder for pagination controls during fetch\n- Prevents product grid from shifting down\n\n### 8. ProductSkeleton.tsx\n**Problem:** Height didn't match actual ProductCard, causing minor shift on load\n**Solution:**\n- Updated to use aspect-square for image (matches ProductCard)\n- Added skeleton for button to match full card height\n- Better visual match for smoother transition\n\n## Best Practices Implemented\n\n1. **Next.js Image Optimization:** Using `next/image` with proper dimensions\n2. **Font Optimization:** Using `next/font` with display: 'swap'\n3. **Loading States:** All async components show skeleton loaders with matching dimensions\n4. **Aspect Ratios:** Using aspect-square for consistent image containers\n5. **No Breaking Changes:** All data-testid attributes and class names preserved\n\n## Result\n\nThe app now has:\n- Minimal to zero Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)\n- Optimized font loading without FOUT\n- Smooth loading transitions with skeleton screens\n- Better Core Web Vitals scores\n- Improved user experience\nEOF\n"]
[211.77041, "o", "cat > /app/LAYOUT_SHIFT_FIXES.md << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> # Layout Shift Fixes Summary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Issues Identified and Fixed\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### 1. ProductCard.tsx\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Problem:** Used regular `<img>` tag without dimensions, causing Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Solution:** \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Replaced `<img>` with Next.js `Image` component\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Added aspect-square container with relative positioning\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Used `fill` prop with `object-cover` for proper sizing\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Added `sizes` attribute for responsive images\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Preserved all data-testid attributes and class names\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### 2. layout.tsx\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Problem:** No optimized font loading, causing FOUT (Flash of Unstyled Text)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Solution:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Added `next/font/google` import for Inter font\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Configured font with `display: 'swap'` for optimal loading\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Applied font className to body element\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Prevents font-swap layout shifts\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### 3. Banner.tsx\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Problem:** Returns null while loading, then suddenly appears with py-24 (96px padding)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Solution:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Added loading state that maintains same dimensions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Shows loading placeholder with same padding during fetch\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Prevents sudden appearance causing layout shift\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### 4. LateBanner.tsx\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Problem:** Returns null while loading, then appears with py-32 (128px padding)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Solution:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Added loading state with consistent dimensions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Shows loading placeholder during fetch\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Maintains layout stability\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### 5. ProductList.tsx\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Problem:** Shows small loading text, then switches to 3-column grid layout\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Solution:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Uses ProductSkeleton components in same grid layout (3 columns, 15 items)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
